    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>87</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;is the time required for the reaction to undergo <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>87</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo></math> completion and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the time required for the reaction to undergo <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math> completion. The relation between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>87</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;for a first order reaction is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>87</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></math><br />The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;(Nearest integer)</p>"
